## 🚀 Features

### **Intelligent Leg Selection**
- Machine learning model trained on 81,000+ historical prop outcomes
- **Direction-aware coverage analysis:** "How often does this player go over/under this line?"
- Pitcher quality integration: ERA-based matchup evaluation
- Handedness matchups: Lefty vs righty performance adjustments
- **Pre-scoring prop filtering:** Only score usable props (odds -500 to +500)

### **Smart Filtering**
- **Prop type exclusions:** stolenBases_under, walks_under (always heavily juiced)
- **Odds range filter:** -500 to +500 (eliminates 152 garbage props)
- Lineup consistency check (minimum 60% games with 3+ AB)
- Game start buffer (15 minutes) to avoid late scratches
- IL/DFA transaction wire integration

### **Parlay Construction**
- Optimized for 4-6 leg parlays at +1000 to +1500 odds
- Avoids same-game conflicts (max 2-3 legs per game)
- Balances risk (over/under distribution, stat type diversity)
- Branch-and-bound algorithm for optimal leg combinations

### **Automated Pipeline**
- **9 AM ET:** Resolve yesterday's bets, fetch full slate, build new parlays
- **12 PM ET:** Refresh odds and check lineups for afternoon games
- **5:30 PM ET:** Final refresh for evening games
- Zero manual intervention required

---

## 🏗️ Architecture

### **Tech Stack**
- **Backend:** Python 3.11
- **Database:** Supabase (PostgreSQL)
- **ML Model:** Scikit-learn RandomForestClassifier
- **Deployment:** Railway (auto-deploy from GitHub)
- **APIs:** 
  - MLB Stats API (free tier)
  - Sportsbook API (100K objects/month quota)
  - Transactions Wire (IL/DFA tracking)

### **Core Components**

```
mlb-parlay-agent/
├── main.py                        # Pipeline orchestration + prop filtering
├── src/
│   ├── engine/
│   │   ├── ml_leg_scorer.py       # ML-based leg scoring
│   │   ├── coverage.py            # Direction-aware coverage calculation
│   │   └── parlay_builder.py     # Parlay construction logic
│   ├── pipelines/
│   │   ├── fetch_props.py         # Fetch props from Sportsbook
│   │   ├── enrich_legs.py         # Add context (pitcher, matchups)
│   │   └── lineup_poller.py       # Lineup verification
│   ├── db/
│   │   └── db.py                  # Database interface
│   └── web/
│       └── server.py              # Web UI + API endpoints + display filtering
├── scripts/
│   ├── train_ml_model.py          # Model training script
│   └── rescore_historical_legs.py # Backfill coverage data
└── models/
    └── leg_scorer_v2.pkl          # Trained ML model (673 KB)
```

